# Tenshodo Membership (jeuno 17): finishes outside their state. A level 75 Warrior at fame level 3 with the form and an
# invite. 107 open, the quest set completed by a GM: no section: nothing (the form kept). The quest set available (a GM):
# the invite traded, 108 open, the quest set completed by a GM: nothing (the invite kept).
lists LowerJeuno/Ghebi_Damomohe/onTrigger LowerJeuno/Ghebi_Damomohe/onTrade LowerJeuno/onEventFinish/107 LowerJeuno/onEventFinish/108
char zone=LowerJeuno pos=17,-0.1,-7.6 job=WAR lvl=75
fame Sandoria 250
keyitem TenshodoApplicationForm
item TenshodoInvite
login
trigger Ghebi_Damomohe                  # 107
quest Jeuno.TenshodoMembership completed # a GM, while 107 is open
finish                                  # nothing
quest Jeuno.TenshodoMembership available # a GM
trade Ghebi_Damomohe TenshodoInvite x1  # 108
quest Jeuno.TenshodoMembership completed # a GM, while 108 is open
finish                                  # nothing
